	(text "SWCLK only flows dock -> nRF, and DOCK_ID only jig -> nRF, so a buffer can do the protection:\nits inputs accept 5.5 V even when powered from 3.1 V, and its output can only swing 0-V3.\nIoff: with V3 off (ship mode) a driven input cannot back-power the rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "51b2c18c-7671-4377-bb9e-013a807b3db4"))
	(text "220R: limits ESD residue and bridge current into the buffer input.\n1M pull-downs: a floating CMOS input draws current and toggles randomly. SWDCLK idles low\n(matches the nRF's internal pull-down). DOCK_ID reads low unless the jig drives it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 204 96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "29e4d501-27e3-4fe8-9397-e5160fc0ee4b"))
